WEBVTT

00:03:29.996 --> 00:03:32.496
which examine differences
between preexisting groups

00:03:32.538 --> 00:03:35.246
rather than inducing changes
within the same individuals,

00:03:35.288 --> 00:03:36.621
means that a single study

00:03:36.663 --> 00:03:40.538
can only demonstrate a correlation
between a substance and a health outcome,

00:03:40.579 --> 00:03:42.996
rather than a true cause 
and effect relationship.

00:03:43.038 --> 00:03:44.163
At the end of the day,

00:03:44.204 --> 00:03:47.704
epidemiological studies have served 
as excellent guides to public health,

00:03:47.746 --> 00:03:49.663
alerting us to critical health hazards,

00:03:49.704 --> 00:03:52.913
such as smoking, asbestos,
lead, and many more.

00:03:52.954 --> 00:03:56.621
But these were demonstrated through
multiple, well-conducted studies,

00:03:56.663 --> 00:03:58.371
all pointing in the same direction.

00:03:58.413 --> 00:04:01.288
So, the next time you see a headline
about a new miracle cure